/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 74 0 R
/E (The Marks & Grade Calculator is a console-based Java application developed to calculate the result of one student in five subjects. This Data Structures and Algorithms \(DSA\) project demonstrates the use of arrays, loops, methods, sorting, searching and file handling.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
