/E (Linear Search is used because the marks are kept in subject order, so the array is not sorted. Selection Sort compares each mark with the remaining marks and takes O\(N2\) time, which is negligible for N = 5. The total, highest and lowest marks are found with a single pass over the array.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [27 29 28]
>>
endobj
